<title>USA: Air Products Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Air Products Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>ALLENTOWN, Pa. 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.85		    $0.84</p>
<p> Net			 94,000		   93,000</p>
<p> Sales		  1,051,000		  979,000</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.73		    $3.29</p>
<p> Net			    416			368</p>
<p> Sales		  4,008,000		3,865,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE - First Call mean estimate for Q4 was $0.84 per share.</p>
<p>Twelve months ended September 30, 1996, includes an after-tax gain of $41 million, or $0.36 per share, from the settlement with Bankers Trust Co over losses reported in fiscal 1994 associated with leveraged interest rate swap contracts.</p>
<p>Twelve months ended September 30, 1995, includes an after-tax gain of $6 million, or $0.06 per share, from the sale of an industrial gas plant.</p>
<p>Full company name is Air Products and Chemicals Inc</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
